Package: winratioReg
Type: Package
Title: Flexible Regression Methods for Covariate-Specific Win Ratios
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zhiguo", "Li", email = "zhiguo.li@duke.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Xiaofei", "Wang", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Implements flexible estimation and inference for covariate-specific
    win ratios with prioritized time-to-event outcomes. The package provides a
    local inverse probability of censoring weighted (IPCW) estimator and a
    model-based proportional hazards copula estimator with Bernstein-sieve
    baseline hazards and BB1, Clayton, Frank, Gaussian, or Gumbel working
    survival copulas. The package also provides bootstrap inference, best linear
    projections, constancy and log-linearity tests, and optional BIC selection
    of a common Bernstein degree.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
